      "html": "<p><strong>Scientific name:</strong> Pseudolithoxus tigris (Armbruster &amp; Provenzano, 2000)</p><p><strong>Common names:</strong> L257, Tigerstribet Flyversugemalle (Denmark), Tigerstriped Plane Pleco</p><p><strong>Synonym:</strong> Lasiancistrus tigris</p><p><strong>Pronunciation:</strong> sue doh lith ox uss</p><p><strong>Size:</strong> 94 mm (3.7\") SL</p><p><strong>Temperature:</strong> 23.0-27.0°C (73.4-80.6°F)</p><p><strong>IUCN Red List category:</strong> Least Concern, last assessed 2021.</p>"
    },
    {
