      "html": "<p>South America: Orinoco, Upper Orinoco, Ventuari.</p><p>Type locality: backwater of Río Orinoco behind a sand playa, approximately 0.5 hr upstream from Isla Temblador, 3°04'N, 66°28'W, Estado Amazonas, Venezuela.</p>"
